{"id":"994bce235fe37ad3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-arith-complete.md","title":"完全性不能降级","display":"thm-arith-complete — 完全性不能降级","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-arith-complete","aliases":["20-thm-arith-complete"],"display":"thm-arith-complete — 完全性不能降级","chapter":"4","section":"4.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 4.2.3 的直接推论","source_pdf_pages":[121],"source_printed_pages":[85],"depends_on":["[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-thm-arithstrict]]","[[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-arith-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-arith-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arith-complete — 完全性不能降级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 4.2.3 的直接推论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>121</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e4e35763e70ecc9\" href=\"?note=7e4e35763e70ecc9\" title=\"20-thm-arithstrict\">20-thm-arithstrict</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1b896a0e27f3a8f\" href=\"?note=e1b896a0e27f3a8f\" title=\"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage\">20-thm-arithmetic-preimage</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}_m(A,\\Sigma^0_n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}_m(A,\\Sigma^0_n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e4e35763e70ecc9\" href=\"?note=7e4e35763e70ecc9\" title=\"20-thm-arithstrict\">20-thm-arithstrict</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e1b896a0e27f3a8f\" href=\"?note=e1b896a0e27f3a8f\" title=\"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage\">20-thm-arithmetic-preimage</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arith\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad A\\notin\\Delta^0_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arith\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad A\\notin\\Delta^0_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Pi_n\">\\(A\\in\\Pi_n\\)</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Sigma_n\">\\(B\\in\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，完全性给普通全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=f^{-1}[A]\">\\(B=f^{-1}[A]\\)</span>；逆像闭包使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Pi_n\">\\(B\\in\\Pi_n\\)</span>。取层级严格性证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\\setminus\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\setminus\\Pi_n\\)</span> 见证即矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin\\Pi_n\">\\(A\\notin\\Pi_n\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\\subseteq\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\subseteq\\Pi_n\\)</span> 给第二项。前提包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma_n\">\\(A\\in\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 与困难性两部分，缺一不能套用此推导。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 4.2.3；印刷 85 / PDF 121。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-arithstrict","status":"resolved","id":"7e4e35763e70ecc9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-arithstrict]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"e1b896a0e27f3a8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]；see [[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-arithstrict","status":"resolved","id":"7e4e35763e70ecc9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]；see [[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-arithmetic-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"e1b896a0e27f3a8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]；see [[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Complete}_m(A,\\Sigma^0_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arith\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad A\\notin\\Delta^0_n.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B=f^{-1}[A]","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n\\setminus\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\notin\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n\\subseteq\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma_n","display":false}],"bytes":1284,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["422e06e55bbb8b2f","7e4e35763e70ecc9","e1b896a0e27f3a8f"]}